      "content": "That makes sense. I'm particularly concerned about the inconsistency in heat absorption during extreme duty cycles. Sometimes the system behaves predictably, but other times the thermal management seems to \"act up\" or fail in ways that don't align with the expected gradient. What factors usually cause these sudden, erratic deviations in thermal performance?",
