      "content": "Could you elaborate on those unpredictable deviations? I'm trying to differentiate between actual mechanical failure and those more \"mischievous\" or sudden performance drops that seem to happen for no reason. Is there a specific way these localized hot spots or \"erratic\" behaviors manifest in the telemetry data?",
